{
  "about": "The cases the filter language must answer the same way in every engine. Written by the Python suite (tests/ddd/test_criteria_parity.py) and read by both: the in-memory evaluator here and the TypeScript engine in @sincpro/criteria. Do not edit by hand.",
  "rows": [
    {
